{% set headline = "Welcome to the Federation" %}
{% block body %}
Your operator registry license for {{ name }} has been activated successfully.

  Developer account:  {{ developer_email }}
  Bundle:             {{ bundle_status | default('Provisioned: download from the Operator Portal') }}

{% if pull_token %}
--- Docker Image Registry Credentials (token auth) ---
  Username:    {{ docker_username }}
  Pull Token:  {{ pull_token }}
